    <description>When Quote ‘Submitted Date’ is Today, the logged-in User’s &apos;Sales Team&apos; equals ‘AO’, and the ‘Customer Amount’ and ‘Max Quote Values’ meet the defined criteria, send the Email Alert to the specified recipients.</description>
